{"id":"mermaid-tear","name":{"en":"Mermaid Tear","ja":"マーメイドの涙"},"desc":{"en":"A jewel found in the deepest parts of the sea. People say it may be a tear shed by a mermaid. It's very rare and very expensive.","ja":"海底の奥底で採れる宝石。その水滴のような 形状、儚さを感じさせる色合いから、人魚の 流した涙ではないかと伝わっている。現存数 が少なく、極めて希少価値が高い。"},"level":5,"locations":[{"id":"arland-area","name":{"en":"Arland Area","ja":"アーランド周辺地域"}},{"id":"primordial-island","name":{"en":"Primordial Island","ja":"原初の島"}},{"id":"silver-lands","name":{"en":"Silver Lands","ja":"白銀の大地"}}],"categories":[{"id":"jewel","name":{"en":"(Jewel)","ja":"（宝石類）"},"icon":"totori-category-jewel"},{"id":"mystery","name":{"en":"(Mystery)","ja":"（神秘の力）"},"icon":"totori-category-mystery"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":46}